      "omega_var": "std(C_late) / mean(C_late)",
      "floquet_order": "exp(-ih\u00b7\u03a3X) \u00b7 exp(-ib\u00b7\u03a3Z) \u00b7 exp(-iJ\u00b7\u03a3ZZ)"
    },
    "models": {
      "KI_chaotic": "J=1.0, h=0.5, b=0.5, OBC",
      "KI_mixing": "J=0.1, h=0.5, b=0.0, OBC",
      "KI_dual_unitary": "J=h=b=\u03c0/4, OBC",
      "Integrable": "exp(-i\u03c0/4\u00b7\u03a3X), no entangling",
      "SYK": "all-to-all 2-body Pauli, 10 seeds (42-51)"
    },
    "notes": [
      "Floquet prethermal ELIMINADO (id\u00e9ntico a KI_mixing con estos par\u00e1metros)",
      "KI_dual_unitary \u03a9=1.000 es correcto: Pauli Z ciego a dual-unitary scrambling",
      "KI_mixing \u03a9\u21921 con D_MAX grande: quasi-periodicidad, no ausencia de scrambling",
      "Tres mecanismos distintos para \u03a9\u22481: (1) sin scrambling (Integrable), (2) scrambling invisible a Pauli Z (dual-unitary), (3) recurrencias dominan saturaci\u00f3n (mixing)",
      "KI_mixing: \u03a9_full < \u03a9_late para N>=6. OTOC primero baja (scrambling inicial) y luego sube (recurrencia). Invierte la relaci\u00f3n usual donde el transitorio infla \u03a9_full. Documentado por Epistemol\u00f3gico sesi\u00f3n 27."
    ]
  },
